          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Section_-_6.png",
            "heading": "THE CLOSE",
            "text": "Tangelos exists for the people who know the difference between a claim and a certificate, a price and a margin, organic and genuinely organic. The ones who decided that wasn't too much to ask.\n\n<br>\nWe are glad they led you here.\n<br>\n<br>\n— Tangelos, London."
