            "heading": "Join A Community That Shares Your Values",
            "text": "<p>tangelos isn't just a bedding - it's a thoughtful lifestyle choice. We unite people who value honest materials, genuine craftsmanship, and ethical practices.<strong>Join thousands across the UK who trust us, reflected in our 4.8 Trustpilot rating,</strong>and who believe in making sleep restorative, responsible, and personal.</p>"
